# Recreation specification: `custom-nice-product.liquid`

Audit date: 2026-06-27

## 1. Purpose

Recreate the product-page features documented here in another Shopify theme.

The destination implementation must use the destination theme's existing/native product section, product form, variant state, gallery, media modal, money formatter, cart drawer, app blocks, translation system, CSS variables, and section lifecycle wherever those capabilities already exist. Do not transplant this section wholesale and do not copy its theme-specific cart renderer or global JavaScript.

The objective is functional and visual parity at the feature level, adapted to the architecture of the destination theme.

Before implementation, inspect the destination theme and map each required behavior to a native component. Typical mappings are: the existing variant picker plus custom card contents, the native media gallery plus variant-metafield images, and the native product form/cart drawer with no parallel cart implementation.

